OL,3,AJury in Katie Price ex's trial told to
OL,4,Aignore egos
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors in the rape trial of Katie
OL,7,FPrice's ex-husband have been told to
OL,8,Fcut through the "big egos" and "big
OL,9,Fpersonalities" involved in the case
OL,10,Fbefore considering their verdicts.
OL,12,FKieran Hayler, 39, is on trial at Lewes
OL,13,FCrown Court charged with three counts
OL,14,Fof rape and one count of sexual assault
OL,15,Fof a 13-year-old girl in West Sussex in
OL,16,F2016, which he denies.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
