OL,3,AJury in Katie Price ex's trial told to
OL,4,Aignore egos
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a closing speech on Monday,
OL,7,Fprosecutor Ryan Richter told jurors:
OL,8,F"You've seen the whirlwind of what is
OL,9,FKatie Price and you're going to make an
OL,10,Fassessment of her, how it affects this
OL,11,Fcase, how much it helps you decide.
OL,13,F"The prosecution accept you're likely
OL,14,Fto treat her evidence with caution."
